# License — worlds/sample-world (Emberfield)

Two kinds of thing live here, licensed separately.

## World content (CC0)

The *writing* that makes Emberfield — `world.json`, `map.md`, `voices/`,
`lore/`, contracts, and any prose or JSON — is dedicated to the public
domain under [Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

You can copy, modify, distribute, and use it for any purpose. Where
practical, attribution to "vefr sample-world (Emberfield), by Rylee
Hulgan" is appreciated but not required.

## Bundled art (`assets/`)

`assets/kenney/` contains room/prop tiles from Kenney (kenney.nl),
licensed under CC0 1.0 — public domain, no attribution required. Each
sheet keeps its own license text (`LICENSE-*.txt`), and this folder
may be swapped or deleted without affecting the engine.

Why CC0: the demo is meant to be replaceable without obligations. Art
that can't be redistributed would make "replace everything" less honest,
so the sample world carries only CC0 art.